PetalburgCity_House1_Text_H0::
    .string "Grandpa says he sailed to KANTO\n"
    .string "once, when he was young.\p"
    .string "And you came all the way from\n"
    .string "there? On purpose?\p"
    .string "When I'm big I'll go the other way.\n"
    .string "Then we'll be even.$"

PetalburgCity_House1_Text_H1::
    .string "KANTO! I saw VERMILION's harbour\n"
    .string "once, sixty years ago.\p"
    .string "Tell me, is it still full of\n"
    .string "sailors arguing about the weather?$"
